# Urgent Necropsy: "As an additional cost to cast this spell, collect evidence X, where X is the total mana value of the
# permanents this spell targets." X is worked out once the targets are chosen (CR 601.2c, 601.2f), and a permanent counts once
# however many slots chose it: Bot2's Haywire Mite (an artifact creature, mana value 1) is its target artifact and its target
# creature, Goblin Bombardment (2) its target enchantment, no planeswalker - X is 3, not 4. Bot1's graveyard holds three
# Lightning Bolts (3 in all) and the Black Lotus that paid (0): the Bolts are exiled as evidence, which would not be enough
# for 4. Both targets are destroyed together, the Mite once though it was targeted twice (its death gives Bot2 2 life, once).

